---
---

<section id="profile" class="hero">
  <p class="reveal kicker" style="--delay:0">Woodinville, WA</p>
  <h1 class="reveal" style="--delay:0">Zhanbolot &ldquo;John&rdquo; Eraliev</h1>
  <p class="reveal role" style="--delay:1">
    Cloud Support Associate &mdash; Summer 2027 internship
  </p>
  <p class="reveal credentials" style="--delay:2">
    AWS Certified Solutions Architect &ndash; Associate. BS in IT Management,
    graduating 2028.
  </p>
  <p class="reveal tagline" style="--delay:2">
    I troubleshoot infrastructure from the packet up.
  </p>

  <div class="reveal badges" style="--delay:3">
    <a
      href="https://www.credly.com/badges/f485fabc-4b43-4383-b4df-69ab72ca26cc"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="aws-badge"
    >
      <img
        src="/assets/badges/aws-saa.png"
        alt=""
        width="64"
        height="64"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <span class="aws-badge-text">
        <span class="status status-earned">Earned</span>
        AWS Solutions Architect &ndash; Associate
        <span class="sr-only">— verify on Credly (opens in new tab)</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    <span class="az-badge">
      <span class="status status-progress">In progress</span>
      AZ-104 &middot; Azure Administrator Associate
    </span>
  </div>

  <a class="reveal cta" style="--delay:4" href="/resume">View résumé →</a>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vh, 6rem) 3rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 6vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
  }

  .role {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3.4vw, 1.375rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-route);
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .credentials {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    opacity: 0.75;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .aws-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem 0.35rem 0.35rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .aws-badge:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-route);
  }

  .aws-badge img {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
  }

  .aws-badge-text,
  .az-badge {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .az-badge {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }

  .status {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .status::before {
    content: "";
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 1px;
  }

  .status-earned {
    color: var(--color-relay);
  }
  .status-earned::before {
    background: var(--color-relay);
  }

  .status-progress {
    color: var(--color-flare);
  }
  .status-progress::before {
    background: var(--color-flare);
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-route);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--color-route);
    padding-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .cta:hover {
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fade-rise 320ms ease-out calc(var(--delay) * 60ms) forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fade-rise {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(12px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
